WEBVTT

00:06:58.581 --> 00:07:00.124
or nationalities or religions.

00:07:00.166 --> 00:07:03.294
We connect with them as human beings,

00:07:03.335 --> 00:07:05.671
and it's worth noting
that that is the first step

00:07:05.713 --> 00:07:08.549
in being able to work together
to solve those problems.

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:11.927
Fun also makes us healthier.

00:07:11.969 --> 00:07:13.554
Being lonely and stressed out,

00:07:13.596 --> 00:07:16.932
as many of us have been
for the past two years,

00:07:16.932 --> 00:07:20.769
causes hormonal changes in our bodies
that increase our risks for disease.

00:07:20.811 --> 00:07:22.354
But when we have fun,

00:07:22.396 --> 00:07:24.773
we're relaxed and we're more
socially connected,

00:07:24.815 --> 00:07:27.401
both of which have the opposite effect.

00:07:27.818 --> 00:07:30.821
So, kind of blows my mind every time
I think about it this way,